#: ../../index.md:11 d63a539d1e404d5aadef8cd96a543c8e
msgid ""
"This book serves readers encountering efficiency analysis for the first time"
" and researchers who need rigorous model choice, reproducible computation, "
"and disciplined reporting. The text explains why and when to use a method, "
"while worked examples show how its conclusions can be reproduced and "
"examined with DEAPack."
msgstr ""
"本书既面向初次接触效率分析的读者，也服务于需要严谨选择模型、开展可重复计算并规范报告结果的研究者。正文解释一种方法为什么适用、何时适用，完整案例则展示如何用"
" DEAPack 重现并审视相应结论。"

#: ../../index.md:97 a8f6f3abf8e744288871c0ad749ba8a0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each chapter can be read independently online or followed in sequence from "
"the navigation. Readers new to DEA should begin with {doc}`reading-guide`. "
"The opening sequence first establishes what performance means, then asks who"
" can credibly be compared, and only then constructs a production technology."
" For exact parameters, return fields, and exception behavior, consult the "
"separate DEAPack Documentation."
msgstr ""
"各章既可以在线独立阅读，也可以按照导航顺序学习。初识 DEA 的读者宜从 {doc}`reading-guide` "
"开始。开篇先厘清绩效意味着什么，再讨论哪些对象可以进行可信比较，最后才构造生产技术。如需查询精确的参数、返回字段和异常行为，请参阅单独编写的 "
"DEAPack 文档。"

